# CMake build output
build/

# Staged/zipped output from tools/package_release.ps1
dist/

# Reference material -- source rulebook PDFs (PHB, DMG, Dragonlance
# sourcebooks/modules) and the Chronicles novels, all copyrighted TSR/
# Wizards of the Coast (or Weis/Hickman) material kept locally only to
# verify rules/lore content against. Not meant to be committed or
# redistributed. See docs/CHARACTER_NOTES.md.
References/*
*.pdf

# Exception: dragonlancemap2.png is used with the explicit permission of
# its author (paercebal, building on AtenOkke's original), obtained
# 2026-09-03 -- see docs/MAP_NOTES.md's "Source and attribution". Unlike
# the copyrighted material above, it's fine to track and redistribute as
# long as both are credited (already done in README.md/MAP_NOTES.md).
!References/dragonlancemap2.png

# Generated preview from tools/generate_overworld.py -- an inspection aid,
# not game data (data/overworld.grid is the real output and IS committed).
data/overworld_preview.png

# Player savegame -- personal session state, not project data. See
# docs/ARCHITECTURE.md / game::SaveGame. save.txt (singular) is the old
# pre-Milestone-89 single-save filename, kept ignored in case a stray one
# lingers from before the save1/2/3.txt slot migration.
save.txt
save1.txt
save2.txt
save3.txt

# Editor/IDE cruft
.vs/
*.user

# Claude Code local tool state (scheduled-task locks, etc.) -- not project
# data. Agent definitions under .claude/agents/ ARE tracked project config.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/

# Scratch pdftotext dumps and self-test artifacts left at repo root by past
# research/verification sessions -- not meant to be committed (some contain
# full copyrighted book text extracted for sourcing checks, see CLAUDE.md's
# throwaway self-test pattern and non-infringement discipline).
dat_full.txt
dl1_full.txt
steel_selftest_save.txt
.research/

